  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Frequent maritime attacks and visible disruptions to trade and energy flows increase domestic political pressure to prioritize national maritime and energy security, reducing public and parliamentary tolerance for sustained high-cost support to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
