  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained upward shock to benchmark oil prices feeds directly into headline inflation and inflation expectations, prompting central banks to tighten monetary policy and raise short-term policy rates to anchor inflation.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_houthi_escalation</data>
