  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid rise in oil benchmark prices increases inflation and borrowing costs and diverts investor allocation toward energy and defensive assets, reducing near‑term VC and corporate capex available for AI infrastructure projects.</data>
