  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp increases in missile and drone strikes create episodic volatility and operational/settlement risks that prompt market‑makers to pull back and widen quotes, reducing bond market depth and liquidity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
