  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased available Russian defense funds are used to purchase missiles, components, and technical assistance from North Korean suppliers and to finance capacity upgrades, directly expanding DPRK factory throughput and production lines for offensive missiles.</data>
