<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_transfer" target="global_financial_stress::corporate_spread_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in cross‑border technology transfers lowers operational and adaptation risk for multinational tech firms (improving production flexibility and revenue prospects), which reduces perceived credit risk and compresses their corporate bond spreads.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_transfer" target="north_korea_nuclear::missile_prod_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased cross-border transfers of tacit knowledge, tooling designs and manufacturing practices (via diaspora engineers, contractors, or covert procurement networks) enable North Korean facilities to adopt higher-yield production techniques and scale production lines, raising missile output per unit time.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">north_korea_nuclear</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::cross_border_transfer" target="russia_ukraine_war::aerial_strike_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased cross‑border transfer of dual‑use AI software, navigation chips and tacit engineering know‑how to Russian procurement networks directly improves guidance, autonomy and endurance of loitering munitions and cruise/UCAV systems, raising the sustained rate of aerial strikes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
