<edge source="north_korea_nuclear::missile_prod_capacity" target="global_financial_stress::corporate_spread_level" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A rapid rise in North Korea's missile production capacity increases the assessed probability of strikes and supply‑chain disruption for regional firms and insurers, causing investors to demand higher credit spreads on corporates with exposure to those risks.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">north_korea_nuclear</data>
  <data key="d39">global_financial_stress</data>
</edge>
<edge source="north_korea_nuclear::missile_prod_capacity" target="russia_ukraine_war::aerial_strike_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in North Korea's missile production capacity enables larger, faster shipments of complete missiles and missile components to Russia, directly enlarging Russia's munitions stockpiles and permitting a higher sustained rate of missile/loitering-munition strikes in Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">north_korea_nuclear</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="north_korea_nuclear::missile_prod_capacity" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::export_control_intensity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Credible intelligence or visible evidence of a sustained increase in North Korean missile industrial output triggers US administrative actions and diplomatic pressure on allied suppliers to broaden export restrictions on components and tooling used in missile guidance and propulsion, which spill over into tighter controls on related high‑end tech sent to China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">north_korea_nuclear</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
