  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Demonstrated mass‑producibility of weapons reliant on advanced compute or guidance chips leads the US and partner governments to tighten controls and pressure equipment and IP suppliers, slowing or cancelling fab expansions and technology transfers that would otherwise increase advanced semiconductor fabrication capacity accessible to China.</data>
