<edge source="north_korea_nuclear::tech_diffusion_rate" target="iran_houthi_escalation::maritime_incident_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Accelerated diffusion of dual‑use and maritime strike technologies from North Korea to Iranian networks or Houthi proxies directly enables more effective anti-ship missiles, unmanned surface/underwater vehicles and naval mines, increasing the frequency and lethality of attacks on vessels and port infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
