  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising sovereign yields increase governments' debt‑service burdens and the cost of sovereign‑backed loans or guarantees, making states more likely to delay or shrink subsidy and guarantee packages that underwrite new advanced fab projects, slowing fabrication capacity expansion.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_financial_stress</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
