  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Widening corporate credit spreads increase financing costs and liquidity strain for cloud providers and hardware vendors, prompting them to defer big GPU/TPU orders and slow cluster expansions, reducing near‑term growth in global AI compute capacity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
