<edge source="global_financial_stress::portfolio_rebalancing_fl" target="north_korea_nuclear::cross_border_cap_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">When investors rapidly rebalance away from emerging/illiquid assets into safe cash or home-market securities, net international private and institutional capital available for technology and energy sectors falls, directly reducing cross‑border capital flow rates that could finance intermediaries or suppliers linked to DPRK procurement.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_financial_stress</data>
